{"canonicalKey":"ethics.support_without_rescuing","contentHash":"e3e407e387134cceb83dc1d4a330748998b55110c573f4f8d051b38991da6d14","contentType":"original_synthesis","formalTheoryChunk":false,"schemaVersion":"xinzhili.chunk-preview.v1","sourceKind":"card","status":"draft","text":"支持他人而不扮演拯救者。支持是提供选择、资源和陪伴；拯救则可能替代他人决定、忽略拒绝，并让帮助者越过能力边界。"}
